    "regime_notes": "Positive and stable across early, mid, and recent regimes at the 40-session horizon. IC is negative at 10 sessions and therefore this is horizon-specific, not a short-horizon replacement for the existing 10-day ensemble factors. Small 15-asset cross-section warrants conservative interpretation.",
